+* Hardware information falls back to the device tree on systems
+  without DMI (HardwareModel, HardwareVendor, Chassis), and
+  HardwareVendor prefers sys_vendor over board_vendor.
+* Chassis detection recognises server, embedded and mini-PC
+  SMBIOS types; slack/hostnamectl uses the same table.
+* Authorization that needs interactive authentication now fails with
+  org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.InteractiveAuthorizationRequired so
+  clients can retry with interactive=true.
 
